  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You illuminate your enemies with a ghostly light, exposing their location and vulnerabilities.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Until the start of your next turn, enemies who enter or begin their turn within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point glow visibly, even if they leave the area.</p><p>While affected by the spell, a target's <strong>Defense</strong> decreases by <strong>-1</strong> and they have <strong>Greater Disadvantage</strong> on <strong>Stealth</strong> checks to hide.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may further decrease the affected creatures <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>-1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.L33k9faHkDgDUmHi]{Highlight}</p>",
